  "analysis": "The Docker work pool 'my-docker-pool' was created successfully (UUID: deb20afa-ca19-436e-b658-54cb553f6891). Now I need to create the deployment. I'll use the `prefect deploy` command to create the deployment for the hello-docker-flow using the my-prefect-image:latest Docker image.",
  "plan": "Create the deployment using `prefect deploy` with the proper configuration. I'll need to specify:\n- The flow file: flow.py:hello_docker_flow\n- The deployment name: docker-deployment\n- The work pool: my-docker-pool\n- The Docker image: my-prefect-image:latest",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "cd /home/user/project && prefect deploy flow.py:hello_docker_flow --name docker-deployment --pool my-docker-pool --image my-prefect-image:latest\n",
      "duration": 10.0
    }
  ]
}

