  "analysis": "The `--image` option doesn't exist for `prefect deploy` directly. The suggestion is `--tag` but that's different. For Docker deployments, the image is configured as a job variable in the work pool configuration. Let me check the help for `prefect deploy` and figure out how to set the Docker image properly.",
  "plan": "I'll check the prefect deploy help and look for ways to specify the Docker image. The Docker image is typically set as a job variable override for the deployment.",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "prefect deploy --help\n",
      "duration": 2.0
    }
